    [43] = {
        name = "Kalimdor Explorer",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - A purchasable scouting-map toy provides a shortcut; manual exploration is also available.\n\n1. Choose the scouting-map shortcut or the exploration route. Check your Toy Box first: an already learned Kalimdor scouting map can simply be used again.\n\n2. For the shortcut, Alliance buy Scouting Map: Surviving Kalimdor from Krom Stoutarm in Ironforge (74.6,9.8). Horde buy Scouting Map: Walking Kalimdor with the Earthmother from Estelle Gendry atop Orgrimmar's main gate (56.8,89.8). The base price is 10,000 gold, with no prior Explorer achievement requirement.\n\n3. Learn and USE the toy, then check Kalimdor Explorer and its zone achievements. Since the map update it grants exploration as well as flight paths. Complete any remaining criterion using its individual zone guide; do not buy an Eastern Kingdoms or Cataclysm map for this continent.\n\n4. For a manual route, start with the northwestern group: Teldrassil -> Darkshore -> Ashenvale -> Felwood -> Moonglade -> Winterspring. Restore pre-burning Teldrassil/Darkshore through Zidormi at Darkshore 48.9,24.5. Include BOTH Azuremyst and Bloodmyst Isles from the meta's checklist.\n\n5. Central group: Azshara -> Durotar -> Northern Barrens -> Mulgore -> Southern Barrens -> Dustwallow Marsh. Work on each zone's missing SUBZONES; old lists treating the Barrens as a single map are outdated.\n\n6. Western/southern group: Stonetalon -> Desolace -> Feralas -> Thousand Needles -> Tanaris -> Un'Goro -> Silithus. Use the flooded Thousand Needles route and Zidormi's pre-wound Silithus. Check the 21 zone criteria after the last circuit.",
