        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Ordinary battleground objectives or cumulative counters require several matches and active participation.\n\n1. Queue for a regular Arathi Basin match through the PvP interface. Track the achievement before the gates open; assault and defend are different actions recorded on the scoreboard.\n\n2. Personally click three neutral or enemy-owned flags in ONE match and finish each uninterrupted channel. Protect the flag clicker if helping a friend, but take your own three assaults for your achievement.\n\n3. An assault starts a contested capture timer. Instantly restoring a flag your team already owned is a DEFEND and does not replace one of the three assaults. Recheck the counter before the match ends.",
