    [150] = {
        name = "The Fishing Diplomat",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Catch an ordinary fish in both capitals, including a trip through hostile territory.\n\n1. Learn Fishing and fish up an item in your OWN capital first: Stormwind for Alliance or Orgrimmar for Horde. Loot the catch and check that half of the achievement before traveling. This requires one catch in BOTH cities, not a rare fish.\n\n2. For Stormwind, use a canal or its harbor water. Horde can fly/swim north along Westfall's coast and land on a small shore/ruin ledge south of the harbor around Stormwind 30.1,85.8. Confirm your minimap has changed to Stormwind before casting; fishing from Westfall does not count.\n\n3. For Orgrimmar, use the Valley of Honor water. Alliance can approach from the northern hills and land at the top of the waterfall around 58.35,29.37. Watch the flying guard patrol before descending; the lower waterfall around 58,35 is another documented fishing spot. Confirm that you are inside Orgrimmar's boundary.\n\n4. Cast, wait for the bobber splash, and LOOT the catch in the second city. Check the achievement, then leave or hearth. A Fishing skill-up with an empty loot window is not a catch. You can stay in Orgrimmar for Old Crafty if you accept the extra exposure to guards and players.",
