    [158] = {
        name = "Me and the Cappin' Makin' It Happen",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Ordinary battleground objectives or cumulative counters require several matches and active participation.\n\n1. Queue for a regular Arathi Basin match through the PvP interface. Track the achievement before the gates open; assault and defend are different actions recorded on the scoreboard.\n\n2. Personally finish flag channels on neutral or fully enemy-owned bases. An opening Farm/Stables assault is a useful first credit; afterwards follow attacks on lightly defended enemy flags.\n\n3. Use control on the remaining defender and ask teammates to protect your channel. Making the flag contested is enough; it does not need to stay yours through the following capture timer.\n\n4. Repeat for 50 assaults. Defenses, kills beside a flag and merely being near someone else's channel are not a substitute for your own scoreboard assaults.",
