    [159] = {
        name = "Let's Get This Done",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - The objective depends on tight timing, an unusual match situation, coordinated team control or many victories.\n\n1. Queue for a regular Arathi Basin match through the PvP interface. Track the achievement before the gates open; assault and defend are different actions recorded on the scoreboard.\n\n2. Agree on routes before the match starts. Split between the near flag, Gold Mine, Lumber Mill and Blacksmith, with a fast group putting the enemy's near flag into contention.\n\n3. Secure all five bases quickly, then leave defenders and rotate reinforcements instead of chasing kills. A five-cap accelerates scoring enough for the six-minute target.\n\n4. Win within six minutes of the actual match start. Being present for only the last six minutes of a longer match is not the condition.",
