    [161] = {
        name = "Resilient Victory",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - The objective depends on tight timing, an unusual match situation, coordinated team control or many victories.\n\n1. Queue for a regular Arathi Basin match through the PvP interface. Track the achievement before the gates open; assault and defend are different actions recorded on the scoreboard.\n\n2. Before attempting a planned comeback, explain the achievement and get the team cooperating. Your team must be behind by AT LEAST 500 resources at some point; a close match or merely losing a base is insufficient.\n\n3. Once that deficit has actually occurred, attack several bases together. Aim to hold four or five, interrupt enemy flag channels and leave defenders so the comeback is not undone by recaptures.\n\n4. Keep controlling the resource race until your team WINS that same match. Recovering the deficit and then losing does not award it. Do not wait until the enemy is nearly at the winning score to begin the comeback.",
        source = "Resilient Victory",
