    [166] = {
        name = "Warsong Gulch Victory",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Ordinary battleground objectives or cumulative counters require several matches and active participation.\n\n1. Queue for regular Warsong Gulch and track this achievement before the gates open. The map shows Warsong Gulch itself; Twin Peaks and other flag battlegrounds are different matches.\n\n2. Escort your carrier from the enemy flag room back to your base, while teammates recover your own flag. Your flag must be home for your carrier to score.\n\n3. Win the match and stay for the result. Three captures finish an ordinary match; if it reaches the time limit, make sure the game's result is a victory for your side.",
