        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Ordinary battleground objectives or cumulative counters require several matches and active participation.\n\n1. Queue for regular Warsong Gulch and track this achievement before the gates open. The map shows Warsong Gulch itself; Twin Peaks and other flag battlegrounds are different matches.\n\n2. Follow enemies carrying your team's flag and help defeat them. When your flag drops on the ground, right-click it immediately to RETURN it.\n\n3. Repeat until your personal return counter reaches 50. An honorable kill on the carrier is not enough by itself, and a teammate clicking the dropped flag gets the return instead of you.",
