        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - The objective depends on tight timing, an unusual match situation, coordinated team control or many victories.\n\n1. Queue for regular Warsong Gulch and track this achievement before the gates open. The map shows Warsong Gulch itself; Twin Peaks and other flag battlegrounds are different matches.\n\n2. Arrange quick carriers and an escort while a separate group recovers your home flag immediately. A second runner can wait near the enemy flag position for the next flag spawn while the first returns.\n\n3. Score three captures and WIN in under seven minutes from the match start. Long carrier standoffs consume the timer, so prioritize killing the enemy carrier and returning your flag over midfield fighting.\n\n4. Be present from the start for the timed attempt. Do not use your own arrival time in a match already in progress to judge the seven-minute condition.",
