    [204] = {
        name = "Ironman",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - The objective depends on tight timing, an unusual match situation, coordinated team control or many victories.\n\n1. Queue for regular Warsong Gulch and track this achievement before the gates open. The map shows Warsong Gulch itself; Twin Peaks and other flag battlegrounds are different matches.\n\n2. Before attempting the run, ask teammates to help you score all three flags, with a healer/escort protecting you and others recovering your home flag. Avoid dying from the start of the match.\n\n3. Carry or receive the first enemy flag and personally score it at your base. Survive the return trip to the enemy base and repeat for the second capture.\n\n4. Personally score the THIRD flag in that same match without a death anywhere in the match. A teammate may carry a flag across the field and hand it to you to score; the three personal captures and your survival are what matter.\n\n5. Check the scoreboard for three captures and zero deaths. Running a flag without scoring, returning your own flag, or getting only a time-limit win does not complete Ironman.",
