    [218] = {
        name = "Alterac Valley Victory",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Ordinary battleground objectives or cumulative counters require several matches and active participation.\n\n1. Queue for Alterac Valley through the PvP interface's Epic Battlegrounds or available specific queue. Track the achievement inside the battleground; the outdoor Alterac caves are not where its objectives happen.\n\n2. Help your team assault and fully burn enemy towers, defend its own towers and protect its captain. Use a forward graveyard to keep reinforcements reaching your attack rather than repeatedly returning from the starting cave.\n\n3. Win by defeating the enemy general or reducing enemy reinforcements to zero. Stay for the victory result and repeat until this achievement records 1 victory.",
