    [222] = {
        name = "Tower Defense",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Ordinary battleground objectives or cumulative counters require several matches and active participation.\n\n1. Queue for Alterac Valley through the PvP interface's Epic Battlegrounds or available specific queue. Track the achievement inside the battleground; the outdoor Alterac caves are not where its objectives happen.\n\n2. Watch YOUR towers/bunkers for an enemy assault. Reach the contested flag while the tower is still standing; a burned tower cannot be defended afterwards.\n\n3. Clear or control the enemy players and personally channel the flag back to your faction before the burn timer expires. The instant restoration is the counted defense; killing attackers without recapping is insufficient.\n\n4. Repeat until the achievement records 50 personal defenses. Home-base towers often get assaulted by a small group while the main fight is elsewhere, so check those as well as the midfield towers.",
