    [223] = {
        name = "The Sickly Gazelle",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Ordinary battleground objectives or cumulative counters require several matches and active participation.\n\n1. Queue for Alterac Valley through the PvP interface's Epic Battlegrounds or available specific queue. Track the achievement inside the battleground; the outdoor Alterac caves are not where its objectives happen.\n\n2. Reach the FIELD OF STRIFE in the middle of the battleground and look for an enemy still riding a mount. The opening mounted crossing gives a natural opportunity.\n\n3. Help kill that enemy before they dismount, staying in range for the honorable kill. A stun can hold the target, but avoid assuming a class sprint counts as a mount or that a kill in another part of Alterac qualifies.",
