        tips = "Use a character eligible for the current quest, rather than the obsolete level-one twink instructions. War Mode has separate populations; do not expect a chest to remain for hours after its spawn. A 2025 report observes a one-hour unlooted despawn.",
        reviewedAt = "2026-11-03",
