    [429] = {
        name = "Sulfuras, Hand of Ragnaros",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - Rare weekly raid drops and substantial crafting materials are required.\n\n1. Use a character that can EQUIP a two-handed mace: Warrior, Paladin, Death Knight, Shaman or Druid. The personal achievement requires equipping the original legendary, even though other classes can now collect its appearance for the Warband.\n\n2. Clear original Molten Core and loot the Eye of Sulfuras from Ragnaros when it drops. Keep the Eye on the character earning the achievement. Repeat after weekly resets as needed; Firelands' similarly named Sulfuras is a different weapon.\n\n3. Obtain the bind-on-equip Sulfuron Hammer. You can buy a finished hammer or have a Classic Blacksmith with the recipe craft it; your achievement character does not need Blacksmithing.\n\n4. If the crafter needs the recipe, take ONE extra Sulfuron Ingot to Lokhtos Darkbargainer in Blackrock Depths' Grim Guzzler. Use his dialogue and A Binding Contract to receive Plans: Sulfuron Hammer. This recipe ingot is additional to the eight consumed by the craft; no Thorium Brotherhood reputation grind is needed just for the contract.\n\n5. For the hammer craft, provide 8 Sulfuron Ingots, 20 Dark Iron Bars, 50 Arcanite Bars, 25 Essences of Fire, 10 Blood of the Mountain, 10 Lava Cores and 10 Fiery Cores. Golemagg in Molten Core supplies ingots; its trash supplies cores and Molten Destroyers can drop Blood of the Mountain. Materials can also be purchased.\n\n6. Have the crafter make the Sulfuron Hammer at the BLACK ANVIL, beside Lord Incendius in original Blackrock Depths. This is a different station from the Black Forge used to smelt Dark Iron. Use the original dungeon, not the anniversary raid or the Dark Iron allied-race scenario.\n\n7. On the eligible character, keep the Sulfuron Hammer in your bags and use the Eye of Sulfuras to combine them into Sulfuras, Hand of Ragnaros. EQUIP the legendary mace for this achievement.",
        source = "Sulfuras, Hand of Ragnaros",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        sourceURL = "https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=429#comments",
