    [628] = {
        name = "Deadmines",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - Follow the legacy dungeon or raid route; the required boss kills are straightforward at current max level.\n\n1. Go to Moonbrook in Westfall, enter the mine building at 42.6, 71.8, and follow the mine passages to the dungeon portal. Set dungeon difficulty to Normal before entering.\n\n2. Clear Glubtok, Helix Gearbreaker and the Foe Reaper 5000. Continue through the foundry and docks, use the cannon to open the large door, and climb the Defias ship to Admiral Ripsnarl.\n\n3. Defeat Ripsnarl and wait for Cookie to appear from the cabin. Approach the cabin if he has not entered his cauldron, then defeat Captain Cookie. He is the Normal final boss; Edwin VanCleef and the Heroic-only Vanessa event are not this achievement's target.",
