    [632] = {
        name = "Blackfathom Deeps",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - Follow the legacy dungeon or raid route; the required boss kills are straightforward at current max level.\n\n1. Go to the ruins at 14.2, 14.0 on the northwestern Ashenvale coast. Swim down through the temple's flooded entrance and follow the underwater passage to the dungeon portal near 16.5, 11.0.\n\n2. Follow the caverns through Ghamoo-Ra, Domina, Subjugator Kor'ul, Thruk and the Guardian of the Deep. Continue into the cultists' temple and defeat Executioner Gore and Twilight Lord Bathiel before the final sanctuary; do not leave after the early turtle or naga encounters.\n\n3. Defeat Aku'mai and confirm the achievement before leaving. The old four-brazier instructions in the comments describe an earlier dungeon layout; use the current encounters and opened passages rather than searching for the removed fire puzzle.",
