    [634] = {
        name = "Gnomeregan",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - Follow the legacy dungeon or raid route; the required boss kills are straightforward at current max level.\n\n1. Go to Gnomeregan's main entrance in western Dun Morogh, descend into the underground station and reach the dungeon portal. The portal pin uses the New Tinkertown entrance map. Set Normal difficulty.\n\n2. Follow the instance toward the Engineering Labs and then Tinkers' Court. Use the ramps and connecting corridors shown on the dungeon map; a fall into a lower room can make the route longer.\n\n3. Defeat Mekgineer Thermaplugg in Tinkers' Court. The optional Workshop back door can shorten a familiar route, but is not a required key or unlock for this achievement.",
