    [636] = {
        name = "Razorfen Downs",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - Follow the legacy dungeon or raid route; the required boss kills are straightforward at current max level.\n\n1. Go to northern Thousand Needles and enter the skull-shaped cave in the Razorfen Downs brambles around 43.3,26.0. Follow the cave and take the first left toward the dungeon portal around 49.3,26.4. Do not enter Razorfen Kraul in Southern Barrens.\n\n2. Progress past Aarux, Mordresh Fire Eye and Mushlump, then climb the Spiral of Thorns with Koristrasza. Reach Death Speaker Blackthorn at the summit and defeat him; his death completes the ritual that brings Amnennar back. Give the encounter's dialogue and transition time to finish before leaving.\n\n3. Defeat the newly summoned Amnennar the Coldbringer and check the achievement. At a scaled level, stand in Koristrasza's Redeemed Soil when she calls for it to handle his Soul Leech. If an instant Blackthorn kill leaves him evading and no lich appears, move back down the path until the encounter advances, then return; a recent Retail report describes this transition workaround.",
        source = "Razorfen Downs",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        sourceURL = "https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=636#comments",
