    [641] = {
        name = "Sunken Temple",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - Follow the legacy dungeon or raid route; the required boss kills are straightforward at current max level.\n\n1. Go to the Temple of Atal'Hakkar in the lake in Swamp of Sorrows, near 69, 54. Descend through the submerged temple entrance and follow the passage to the dungeon portal.\n\n2. Use the CURRENT single-floor Sunken Temple. Clear the troll packs leading to Jammal'an the Prophet and Ogom in the eastern room and defeat them. Clear the dragon encounters on the main route as they become available: Dreamscythe, Weaver, Hazzas and Morphaz. Continue through their rooms toward the southern sanctuary instead of looking for an old basement route.\n\n3. Continue through the southern rooms and defeat Shade of Eranikus. The six upper-ring channelers and the lower-floor statue puzzle described by old comments belong to the removed multi-floor version and are not a Retail route.",
