    [642] = {
        name = "Blackrock Depths",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - Follow the legacy dungeon or raid route; the required boss kills are straightforward at current max level.\n\n1. Enter Blackrock Mountain and descend to the Blackrock Depths dungeon portal. Use the original Normal dungeon, not the anniversary raid version. The old Shadowforge Key is not required.\n\n2. Use the Abandoned Mole Machine at the entrance to travel to Just Past the Grim Guzzler if that option is available. Otherwise progress through Shadowforge City to the bar. Buy SIX Dark Iron Ale Mugs from Plugger Spazzring and give them to Private Rocknot through three two-mug hand-ins. Let him break the barrels, then kill the hostile Phalanx at the opened rear door. Buy the ale BEFORE attacking the bar's vendor.\n\n3. Continue through Ambassador Flamelash and the Summoners' Tomb. Speak to Doom'rel to start the Seven encounter and defeat the successive dwarves to open the next door.\n\n4. In the Lyceum, kill Shadowforge Flame Keepers, loot their torches and light BOTH braziers. Proceed through Magmus to the throne room, then defeat Emperor Dagran Thaurissan. Stop only after the emperor criterion credits.",
