    [643] = {
        name = "Lower Blackrock Spire",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - Follow the legacy dungeon or raid route; the required boss kills are straightforward at current max level.\n\n1. Enter Blackrock Mountain, climb to the Blackrock Spire entrance on the upper balcony and choose the LOWER Blackrock Spire dungeon. The Warlords Upper Blackrock Spire portal is a different instance.\n\n2. Follow the lower route through the ogre and troll areas, then climb through the orc barracks and connecting ramps. Continue beyond the side bosses to the last large chamber.\n\n3. Defeat Overlord Wyrmthalak. General Drakkisath, the Seal of Ascension and the old Upper Spire flame event are not required for this Lower Spire achievement.",
