    [644] = {
        name = "King of Dire Maul",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - Follow the legacy dungeon or raid route; the required boss kills are straightforward at current max level.\n\n1. Travel to Dire Maul in Feralas. There are THREE separate wings, each with a required boss. Use the map selector to choose East, West or North; a clear of only one wing cannot complete the achievement.\n\n2. EAST / Warpwood Quarter, around 64, 30: defeat Zevrim Thornhoof, return to Ironbark in the courtyard and ask him to open the door. Follow the newly opened corridor and defeat Alzzin the Wildshaper.\n\n3. WEST / Capital Gardens, around 60, 30: disable all FIVE pylons by killing their surrounding elementals. There is one near the entrance, two upstairs in the Court of the Highborne and two beside Immol'thar's prison. Once the barrier falls, defeat Immol'thar.\n\n4. NORTH / Gordok Commons, around 62, 24: follow the corridors and ramps to King Gordok and defeat him. The old Gordok door key is no longer required. A tribute run, Ogre Suit and trap materials are optional, not achievement conditions.\n\n5. Check that Alzzin, Immol'thar and King Gordok are all credited. You can leave one wing and enter another normally; the old reports of criteria resetting describe a fixed bug.",
