    [645] = {
        name = "Scholomance",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - Follow the legacy dungeon or raid route; the required boss kills are straightforward at current max level.\n\n1. Go to Caer Darrow in Western Plaguelands and enter the current Scholomance at 69.1, 73.0 on Normal difficulty. The achievement does not require unlocking restored Old Scholomance or obtaining a Skeleton Key.\n\n2. Clear Instructor Chillheart, Jandice Barov and Rattlegore, then continue through Lilian Voss's encounter. Wait for encounter dialogue or doors before moving to the next room.\n\n3. Reach Headmaster's Retreat and defeat Darkmaster Gandling. If he sends you into a study room, kill its enemies and return to the main chamber. The six mini-bosses and Viewing Room Key in old comments describe Old Scholomance, not this route.",
