    [646] = {
        name = "Stratholme",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - Follow the legacy dungeon or raid route; the required boss kills are straightforward at current max level.\n\n1. Go to northern Eastern Plaguelands. This achievement requires the final boss in BOTH halves of present-day Stratholme. Set Normal difficulty; the Caverns of Time Culling of Stratholme is unrelated.\n\n2. Use the MAIN entrance near 27, 12 for the living/Crusader's Square side. Clear the Scarlet rooms to Balnazzar, allow the final encounter to finish and confirm his criterion.\n\n3. Leave and enter the SERVICE entrance at Eastwall Gate near 43.3, 19.7. Kill Baroness Anastari, Nerub'enkan and Maleki the Pallid, and clear the acolytes inside all three opened ziggurats to remove the gate barrier.\n\n4. Clear the abominations in Slaughter Square, kill Ramstein, then wait for and defeat the remaining undead waves and Black Guard. Enter the slaughterhouse and kill Lord Aurius Rivendare. Confirm both bosses are credited before leaving.",
