    [685] = {
        name = "Blackwing Lair",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - Follow the legacy dungeon or raid route; the required boss kills are straightforward at current max level.\n\n1. Enter Blackrock Mountain and reach the Orb of Command beside the Blackrock Spire approach, around 64.2, 71.0 on the upper mountain map. Use the orb for Blackwing Lair. Blackwing Descent on the mountain's exterior summit is a different raid.\n\n2. At Razorgore, clear the enemies around the Orb of Domination and use it to control him. Use his Destroy Egg ability on EVERY egg while keeping him alive. Reapply control as needed; killing Razorgore before the eggs are destroyed wipes the encounter.\n\n3. Once the eggs are gone, defeat Razorgore and progress through Vaelastrasz, the suppression rooms, Broodlord, the three drakes and Chromaggus. Open progression doors using the encounter's switch or dialogue when necessary.\n\n4. Speak to Victor Nefarius in the last room, kill the drakonid waves and wait for Nefarian to land. Defeat Nefarian and confirm the Blackwing Lair achievement. An Onyxia attunement or a kill in Blackwing Descent does not substitute for this clear.",
