        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - Exalted battleground reputation requires a substantial number of objective-focused matches.\n\n1. Use a Alliance character and track The League of Arathor in the reputation panel. Queue for Arathi Basin and concentrate on your team's resource income.\n\n2. Capture bases, leave defenders and reinforce attacks before flags are lost. Reputation is earned as your TEAM generates resources; you do not need to personally click every flag, and a loss can still yield progress.\n\n3. Keep playing until The League of Arathor reaches EXALTED. Check the reputation gained in your actual matches rather than using old comments' 2000-point formulas, removed guild perks or fixed hundreds-of-wins estimates.",
