    [736] = {
        name = "Explore Mulgore",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - Follow the zone discovery pins; no rare drop or organized group is required.\n\n1. Track Explore Mulgore and check which named areas are still missing. Use the Mulgore map for these coordinates. Fly or ride through each missing area's discovery boundary; a fully visible map alone is not proof that every criterion credited.\n\n2. Southern circuit: Red Cloud Mesa (42.8, 80.5) -> Palemane Rock (35.0, 61.4) -> Bloodhoof Village (48.1, 59.2) -> Winterhoof Water Well (53.6, 65.3) -> The Rolling Plains (59.7, 65.7).\n\n3. Central circuit: The Venture Co. Mine (60.7, 47.7) -> Ravaged Caravan (53.5, 48.3) -> Thunderhorn Water Well (44.9, 45.5) -> Bael'dun Digsite (32.8, 48.9) -> The Golden Plains (48.6, 37.6).\n\n4. Northern circuit: Wildmane Water Well (43.1, 16.1) -> Windfury Ridge (51.1, 9.3) -> Red Rocks (60.6, 21.6).\n\n5. Reopen the achievement and check every named criterion. If one is missing, return to its pin and move around the actual subzone, descending toward the ground if necessary. Stop once the discovery credits; extra map shading and nearby dungeons are not additional requirements.",
