    [761] = {
        name = "Explore Arathi Highlands",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - Follow the zone discovery pins; no rare drop or organized group is required.\n\n1. Track Explore Arathi Highlands. Speak to Zidormi at the southern entrance by Thandol Span and select Arathi BEFORE the Battle for Stromgarde. Use that accessible Retail phase and the original Arathi map, rather than the active Warfront map, for this route.\n\n2. Western circuit: Galen's Fall (12.9, 34.9) -> Circle of West Binding (19.0, 31.0) -> Northfold Manor (25.8, 29.6) -> Boulder'gor (29.1, 45.2) -> Stromgarde Keep (19.6, 67.0) -> Faldir's Cove (28.9, 82.8).\n\n3. Southern and central circuit: Thandol Span (39.6, 96.1) -> Boulderfist Hall (48.0, 78.8) -> Witherbark Village (63.0, 75.8) -> Go'Shek Farm (56.6, 60.1) -> Circle of Outer Binding (46.4, 52.2) -> Circle of Inner Binding (29.8, 59.8).\n\n4. Finish the central and northeastern camps: Refuge Pointe (40.1, 47.9) -> Dabyrie's Farmstead (49.6, 40.6) -> Circle of East Binding (61.6, 30.3) -> Hammerfall (69.1, 36.2).\n\n5. Reopen the achievement and check every named criterion. If one is missing, return to its pin and move around the actual subzone, descending toward the ground if necessary. Stop once the discovery credits; extra map shading and nearby dungeons are not additional requirements.",
