    [765] = {
        name = "Explore Badlands",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - Follow the zone discovery pins; no rare drop or organized group is required.\n\n1. Track Explore Badlands and check which named areas are still missing. Use the Badlands map for these coordinates. Fly or ride through each missing area's discovery boundary; a fully visible map alone is not proof that every criterion credited.\n\n2. Western and central circuit: New Kargath (17.7, 44.3) -> Camp Cagg (14.8, 63.1) -> The Dustbowl (24.7, 36.7) -> Scar of the Worldbreaker (36.9, 50.0) -> Agmond's End (46.8, 56.5) -> Bloodwatcher Point (50.5, 46.0).\n\n3. Northern and eastern circuit: Angor Fortress (41.2, 26.8) -> Uldaman (42.3, 11.7) -> Camp Kosh (59.2, 19.5) -> Lethlor Ravine (71.2, 44.4).\n\n4. Reopen the achievement and check every named criterion. If one is missing, return to its pin and move around the actual subzone, descending toward the ground if necessary. Stop once the discovery credits; extra map shading and nearby dungeons are not additional requirements.",
