        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - Follow the zone discovery pins; no rare drop or organized group is required.\n\n1. Track Explore Blasted Lands. At the road from Swamp of Sorrows, speak to Zidormi on the small hill at 48.2,7.2 and ask to see Blasted Lands BEFORE the Iron Horde invasion. Dismount if she is not visible. These old-phase locations remain accessible in Retail through her.\n\n2. Northern circuit: Dreadmaul Hold (41.8, 14.3) -> Rise of the Defiler (45.0, 26.6) -> Nethergarde Supply Camps (52.6, 18.6) -> Nethergarde Keep (60.4, 16.9) -> Serpent's Coil (61.4, 29.4) -> Shattershore (67.5, 31.7).\n\n3. Central circuit: The Dark Portal (54.9, 53.0) -> Dreadmaul Post (45.1, 38.2) -> Altar of Storms (37.0, 28.3) -> The Tainted Scar (32.6, 44.8).\n\n4. Southern circuit: The Tainted Forest (32.6, 80.3) -> Surwich (45.5, 87.0) -> The Red Reaches (50.2, 78.8) -> Sunveil Excursion (50.1, 73.0).\n\n5. Reopen the achievement and check every named criterion. If one is missing, return to its pin and move around the actual subzone, descending toward the ground if necessary. Stop once the discovery credits; extra map shading and nearby dungeons are not additional requirements.",
