    [768] = {
        name = "Explore Tirisfal Glades",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - Follow the zone discovery pins; no rare drop or organized group is required.\n\n1. Track Explore Tirisfal Glades. If your zone shows the blighted/post-battle version, use Zidormi's dialogue at 69.5,62.8 near the eastern road to return to Tirisfal BEFORE the Battle for Lordaeron. Follow the original Tirisfal map for the route below.\n\n2. Western circuit: Deathknell (32.1, 64.6) -> Solliden Farmstead (38.0, 51.1) -> Calston Estate (44.4, 53.2) -> Nightmare Vale (46.0, 69.3) -> Cold Hearth Manor (53.7, 57.0).\n\n3. Central and northern circuit: Agamand Mills (45.9, 29.9) -> Garren's Haunt (58.6, 35.2) -> Brill (60.9, 52.0) -> Brightwater Lake (68.2, 47.6) -> Scarlet Watch Post (79.5, 25.5) -> Scarlet Monastery Entrance (85.1, 31.3).\n\n4. Eastern and southern circuit: Venomweb Vale (83.0, 44.9) -> Crusader Outpost (79.0, 55.6) -> Balnir Farmstead (76.0, 59.6) -> The Bulwark (83.3, 70.5) -> Ruins of Lordaeron (61.9, 67.5).\n\n5. Reopen the achievement and check every named criterion. If one is missing, return to its pin and move around the actual subzone, descending toward the ground if necessary. Stop once the discovery credits; extra map shading and nearby dungeons are not additional requirements.",
