        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - Follow the zone discovery pins; no rare drop or organized group is required.\n\n1. Track Explore Searing Gorge and check which named areas are still missing. Use the Searing Gorge map for these coordinates. Fly or ride through each missing area's discovery boundary; a fully visible map alone is not proof that every criterion credited.\n\n2. Northern circuit: Firewatch Ridge (22.2, 36.3) -> Thorium Point (38.0, 28.2) -> Dustfire Valley (71.5, 33.1).\n\n3. Central and southern circuit: Grimesilt Dig Site (63.5, 60.5) -> The Cauldron (52.0, 50.0) -> The Sea of Cinders (58.3, 71.3) -> Blackrock Mountain (34.6, 82.3) -> Blackchar Cave (21.2, 77.7).\n\n4. Reopen the achievement and check every named criterion. If one is missing, return to its pin and move around the actual subzone, descending toward the ground if necessary. Stop once the discovery credits; extra map shading and nearby dungeons are not additional requirements.",
        source = "Explore Searing Gorge",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        sourceURL = "https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=774#comments",
