    [841] = {
        name = "Explore Wetlands",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - Follow the zone discovery pins; no rare drop or organized group is required.\n\n1. Track Explore Wetlands and check which named areas are still missing. Use the Wetlands map for these coordinates. Fly or ride through each missing area's discovery boundary; a fully visible map alone is not proof that every criterion credited.\n\n2. Western marsh circuit: Menethil Harbor (10.8, 59.5) -> Black Channel Marsh (23.7, 52.5) -> Bluegill Marsh (17.3, 37.2) -> Sundown Marsh (31.0, 30.2) -> Saltspray Glen (32.0, 18.2) -> Whelgar's Excavation Site (33.6, 48.4).\n\n3. Northern and central circuit: Angerfang Encampment (44.0, 43.4) -> Ironbeard's Tomb (44.3, 25.5) -> Dun Modr (49.9, 18.2) -> Direforge Hill (60.9, 25.5) -> Greenwarden's Grove (56.5, 40.2) -> Raptor Ridge (69.9, 38.3).\n\n4. Southern circuit: Mosshide Fen (64.4, 53.3) -> Slabchisel's Survey (57.5, 71.7) -> Thelgen Rock (53.1, 63.5) -> Dun Algaz (48.1, 74.4).\n\n5. Reopen the achievement and check every named criterion. If one is missing, return to its pin and move around the actual subzone, descending toward the ground if necessary. Stop once the discovery credits; extra map shading and nearby dungeons are not additional requirements.",
