        tips = "Withering Thicket is north/northeast of Auberdine's ruins, not the northernmost shoreline. Nazj'vel is the southwestern coastal ruin/island. These are post-Cataclysm landmarks in the pre-Battle-for-Darkshore phase; the original intact Auberdine from Classic Era is not the destination.",
