        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - Follow the zone discovery pins; no rare drop or organized group is required.\n\n1. Track Explore Felwood and check which named areas are still missing. Use the Felwood map for these coordinates. Fly or ride through each missing area's discovery boundary; a fully visible map alone is not proof that every criterion credited.\n\n2. Southern circuit: Deadwood Village (48.3, 85.4) -> Morlos'Aran (53.6, 83.9) -> Emerald Sanctuary (51.8, 81.2) -> Jadefire Glen (43.4, 83.5) -> Ruins of Constellas (41.9, 65.6).\n\n3. Central circuit: Jaedenar (41.4, 56.0) -> Bloodvenom Falls (46.1, 47.5) -> Shatter Scar Vale (39.9, 39.3).\n\n4. Northern circuit: Jadefire Run (45.0, 15.8) -> Irontree Woods (49.8, 16.8) -> Talonbranch Glade (63.1, 21.6) -> Felpaw Village (63.0, 10.0).\n\n5. Reopen the achievement and check every named criterion. If one is missing, return to its pin and move around the actual subzone, descending toward the ground if necessary. Stop once the discovery credits; extra map shading and nearby dungeons are not additional requirements.",
        source = "Explore Felwood",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        sourceURL = "https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=853#comments",
        achievementId = 853,
        category = "Exploration",
