        },
        tips = "Jadefire Glen and Jadefire Run are different sites at opposite ends of the zone. Ruins of Constellas lie between Jaedenar and the southern glen; descend toward the ruins if flying above them does not credit discovery. Felpaw discovery does not require entering Timbermaw Hold or earning its reputation.",
