    [856] = {
        name = "Explore Silithus",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - Follow the zone discovery pins; no rare drop or organized group is required.\n\n1. Track Explore Silithus. If the giant sword has destroyed Cenarion Hold in your phase, speak to Zidormi at 78.8,22.0 and select Silithus BEFORE the wound. Use the original Silithus map and the accessible past-phase landmarks below.\n\n2. Northern circuit: Valor's Rest (81.1, 18.7) -> Cenarion Hold (53.8, 34.5) -> Hive'Ashi (49.4, 24.1) -> The Crystal Vale (34.6, 14.8).\n\n3. Western and southern circuit: Hive'Zora (32.4, 52.3) -> The Scarab Wall (35.9, 83.4) -> Hive'Regal (59.7, 70.8) -> Southwind Village (64.6, 50.1).\n\n4. Reopen the achievement and check every named criterion. If one is missing, return to its pin and move around the actual subzone, descending toward the ground if necessary. Stop once the discovery credits; extra map shading and nearby dungeons are not additional requirements.",
