    [956] = {
        name = "Brood of Nozdormu",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Complete the quest or reputation route, using event currency where available.\n\n1. For a badge route, visit Bobadormu during Classic Timewalking at Stormwind Embassy (56.0, 19.0) or Orgrimmar's main gate (52.8, 83.0). Buy Commendation of the Brood of Nozdormu for 50 Timewarped Badges per 500 base reputation. This faction starts HATED, so the 84-token calculation for a Neutral faction is not its full starting cost.\n\n2. For the raid route, enter the TEMPLE of Ahn'Qiraj (AQ40) in southern Silithus. Kill trash and bosses, looting Qiraji Lord's Insignias from bosses and any Ancient Qiraji Artifacts from trash. Keep these turn-in items while ordinary kills are still helping.\n\n3. Continue clearing trash until its reputation stops at 2,999/3,000 Neutral. Boss kills and turn-ins are the route beyond that point; old Scepter-of-the-Shifting-Sands fragment quests are not a current prerequisite.\n\n4. Clear the raid through the Twin Emperors and C'Thun. Viscidus is optional if you lack the frost-hit and melee-hit tools for his special mechanic. Save the Eye of C'Thun for its one-time quest chain, and keep the insignias/artifacts rather than vendoring them.\n\n5. Return insignias through Mortal Champions to Kandrostrasz near the raid entrance for 500 base reputation each. An Ancient Qiraji Artifact starts its own 1,000-base-reputation turn-in. Use the raid's friendly dragon NPCs for these quests; they are not the outdoor Cenarion Circle vendors.\n\n6. Repeat after weekly resets until Exalted, using any Timewalking commendations to cover the balance. A trash-only reset does not restore killed bosses. Check your actual bar before buying a large batch of tokens or following old exact-run estimates.",
        source = "Brood of Nozdormu",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        sourceURL = "https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=956#comments",
        achievementId = 956,
        category = "Reputation",
