    [1244] = {
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Read 42 specific books across several zones, buildings and dungeons.\n\n1. Track the 42 unread titles in Well Read. Click each ORIGINAL world book to open it, then check its criterion before leaving; paging through every page is unnecessary. The circuit below includes Alliance cities, so an Alliance character is easier. Use the same character for the whole circuit instead of relying on partial progress from several alts.\n\n2. Stormwind Keep, Royal Library around 85,24: check tables, stools AND the tops of short pillars for Aegwynn and the Dragon Hunt; Aftermath of the Second War; Beyond the Dark Portal; Civil War in the Plaguelands; The Alliance of Lordaeron; The Guardians of Tirisfal; The Kaldorei and the Well of Eternity; The New Horde; The War of the Ancients; The World Tree and the Emerald Dream. There are several close objects: opening one book does not read the neighboring titles.\n\n3. Still in Stormwind Keep, enter the battle/war room around 86.7,36.0. Read The Dark Portal and the Fall of Stormwind and War of the Spider from the central table; The Battle of Grim Batol is an additional copy here. If ALL library books are absent, finish the Keep's pending Darkshore introduction/phasing before returning, rather than searching empty tables indefinitely.\n\n4. Stormwind Mage Quarter around 51.9,74.6: enter the house beside the inscription trainer, using its canal-side approach. Read Archimonde's Return and the Flight to Kalimdor and Mount Hyjal and Illidan's Gift. These are in the small house, not the Royal Library.\n\n5. Elwynn Forest, Eastvale Logging Camp around 85.3,69.7: go upstairs in the inn/Marshal Haggard building and read Lethargy of the Orcs from the table. If Icecrown and the Frozen Throne is still missing later, Goldshire's inn has an upstairs copy around 43.8,65.7.\n\n6. Duskwood, Darkshire's Scarlet Raven inn: go upstairs. The right-hand bedroom table around 73.6,45.1 has The Founding of Quel'Thalas; the left room around 74.1,45.4 has Kil'jaeden and the Shadow Pact. Mount Hyjal and Illidan's Gift is another upstairs copy if you missed it in Stormwind.\n\n7. Booty Bay, Cape of Stranglethorn: read Sunwell - The Fall of Quel'Thalas on the Salty Sailor Tavern's second floor (41.0,74.4), with another Beyond the Dark Portal copy on its third floor (40.6,73.8). Above Sea Wolf MacKinley's house, The Sentinels and the Long Vigil is by the bed (42.2,73.6). Descend TWO flights below MacKinley to Auctioneer Kresky's room (42.1,73.7): read Empires' Fall, The Twin Empires, Wrath of Soulflayer and The Scourge of Lordaeron from its tables/shelves, including the shelf under the stairs.\n\n8. Ironforge, Hall of Explorers around 75.7,11.0: search the central table and the four tables around the curved room for Arathor and the Troll Wars; Charge of the Dragonflights; Civil War in the Plaguelands; Ironforge - the Awakening of the Dwarves; Rise of the Horde; The Alliance of Lordaeron; The Battle of Grim Batol; The Old Gods and the Ordering of Azeroth; War of the Three Hammers. Some are duplicates from earlier stops; verify all nine titles.\n\n9. Loch Modan, Thelsamar around 37.2,46.9: enter the eastern house with Brock and Jern outside and read The Last Guardian downstairs. Use this copy instead of Sentinel Hill's inn, where Westfall quest phasing can make the old copy inaccessible.\n\n10. Western Plaguelands, enter CURRENT Normal Scholomance at Caer Darrow (69.1,73.0). Clear through Rattlegore to Lilian Voss's encounter room. Read The Invasion of Draenor, the small red/pink book on the northeastern wall ledge beside a candelabra, around 56.6,41.3 on that room's map. This is not one of the quest books you burn; no restored Old Scholomance unlock is required.\n\n11. Eastern Plaguelands, enter Stratholme through the MAIN Gate (27.1,11.6), then take the western Scarlet Bastion/Crusader's Square route. Check Commander Malor's room near 30.2,41.5 for The Seven Kingdoms. Search the alcoves and tables around Instructor Galford's library near 25.5,70.9 for The Lich King Triumphant; Kel'Thuzad and the Forming of the Scourge; The Birth of the Lich King; Icecrown and the Frozen Throne; War of the Spider; The Scourge of Lordaeron; and Kil'jaeden and the Shadow Pact if still missing. The service-entrance undead half is not this library route.\n\n12. Tanaris, Gadgetzan around 51.0,30.3: read Old Hatreds - The Colonization of Kalimdor from the ground beside Derotain's anvil, baskets and machinery. It is no longer beside the flight master. Gadgetzan's inn also has copies of Empires' Fall, The Twin Empires and Wrath of Soulflayer if you missed Booty Bay's lower room.\n\n13. Restore pre-burning Teldrassil through Zidormi in Darkshore (48.9,24.5), travel through Rut'theran to Darnassus, and read two books: The Betrayer Ascendant at Tradesmen's Terrace (61.9,74.7), and Rise of the Blood Elves on the ground-floor table behind the mining trainer at Craftsmen's Terrace (49.9,33.5). The burned present-day city is not the destination.\n\n14. Northern Barrens, Ratchet: read Exile of the High Elves on the upstairs balcony of Jazzik's General Goods/blacksmith building (67.1,73.4), and Sargeras and the Betrayal on a low table between the beds behind the inn's keg (67.0,75.0). If needed, the nearby hut at 68.0,73.5 has Archimonde's Return and the Flight to Kalimdor, and the inn at 66.9,74.7 has Mount Hyjal and Illidan's Gift.\n\n15. Recheck the full list of 42 titles, including entries below the achievement panel's visible area. Return only for unread titles. Temporary inventory reprints from Legion Dalaran or Love is in the Air's Historic Lore Books do NOT replace reading the original objects for this achievement.",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        source = "Well Read",
        sourceURL = "https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=1244#comments",
        name = "Well Read",
