    [1836] = {
        name = "Old Crafty",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - The required rare fish can take many casts; there is no guaranteed completion time.\n\n1. Learn Fishing and go to Orgrimmar. For the account achievement, using a Horde alt avoids hostile city guards; the fish does not have to be caught by an Alliance main. Skill 1 can catch it, so leveling Fishing to a cap is not a prerequisite.\n\n2. Fly or walk to the Valley of Honor pond. The ledge behind the waterfall around Orgrimmar 62,39 is a documented fishing spot, with recent catches around 61.8,38.6 and 63.4,38.8. Cast into the actual pond, not the waterfall's rock face.\n\n3. Keep fishing in the pond and loot each catch until Old Crafty appears. Free bag space regularly. This is a rare random catch: moving after an arbitrary number of casts, using a particular pole, or reaching a claimed skill total does not guarantee it.\n\n4. Watch the loot window before casting again. If a bind confirmation appears, accept it and make sure Old Crafty reaches your bags. Confirm the achievement before leaving; merely seeing the fish in the loot window, buying it or trading another player's fish does not count.",
        source = "Old Crafty",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
