        tips = "All reputation requirements belong to one character. A rogue is needed to farm the pickpocketed boxes, not to earn the achievement or turn them in. Use a party for shared pirate kills, save box hand-ins for an active reputation buff when convenient, and pace the Faire work across its calendar weeks. Free Knot!, Shen'dralar and Durnholde Syndicate farming are obsolete routes.",
